{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-23",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "留在总编室实习  (Staying On in the Chief Editor's Office)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "When Kaiwen calls to say he has recovered and is returning to work, Xingzi tells Bu Xiaogu her temporary transfer from administration is ending, until Chun Yuqiao makes a surprise staffing decision. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥，你马上就能回来上班？这么快啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我是说太好了，病好得这么快，真好！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "小谷，之前凯文病了，总编室才把你借调过来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "既然凯文回来了，总编室就不需要你再帮忙了，毕竟你是行政部的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "但是总编室工作真的是太多了，早就应该扩充人手了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，要不然咱们从成熟的制片里边挑两个留下来？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "别人的人我们不能抢，各个部门都是要发展的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "他们在一部培训之后，还是要回到本部门。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "那我们缺人手怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "凯文不是回来了吗？先让小谷跟我实习，再让凯文带小谷。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，我真的可以留在总编室啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "行，出去的时候把门带上。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥，你马上就能回来上班？这么快啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kaiwen, you can come right back to work? That fast?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我是说太好了，病好得这么快，真好！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I mean wonderful — recovering that fast is truly great!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "小谷，之前凯文病了，总编室才把你借调过来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, the chief editor's office only seconded you here because Kaiwen fell ill.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "既然凯文回来了，总编室就不需要你再帮忙了，毕竟你是行政部的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now that Kaiwen is back, the office no longer needs your help; after all, you belong to administration.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "但是总编室工作真的是太多了，早就应该扩充人手了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, the chief editor's office really has too much work and should have expanded its staff long ago.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，要不然咱们从成熟的制片里边挑两个留下来？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, why not pick two seasoned producers from the other units and keep them here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "别人的人我们不能抢，各个部门都是要发展的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We cannot poach other people's staff; every department needs room to grow.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "他们在一部培训之后，还是要回到本部门。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After training with Unit One, their people still need to return to their own departments.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "那我们缺人手怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then what do we do about being short-staffed?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "凯文不是回来了吗？先让小谷跟我实习，再让凯文带小谷。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is Kaiwen not back? Have Xiaogu intern under me first, and then have Kaiwen mentor her.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，我真的可以留在总编室啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, may I really stay on in the chief editor's office?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "行，出去的时候把门带上。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes; close the door on your way out.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥，你马上就能回来上班？这么快啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
